      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "The Herdt Campus All-you-can-read range offers members of ETH Zurich free access to the latest software handbooks.\n\nAccess requires a one-off registration and is possible online in ETH Zurich's network or on ETH-Bibliothek premises.\n\nAccess via the Knowledge Portal of ETH-Bibliothek"
